voir","Folklore","Comédie","Agression","Attaque","Mythologie","Destruction","Pirate","Quête","Ship","Trésor","Activité Illégale","En blaguant","Quille","Légende","Légende","Mythe","Hors-la-loi","Sévère","Équipe","Carte au trésor","Animation Dessinée à La Main","Animation Isekai","Indien aztèque","Aventure flibustière","action","action","action","aventure","aventure","animation","animation anime","Relation Homme Garçon","Distribution masculine","Shonen"],"title":"One Piece, film 1 : Le Film","title_original":"ワンピース","trending":0,"vote_average":6.8},{"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wMzToVniA09xWS0DXSRQiufVvpZ.jpg","color":"#f1bb35","episode_count":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Animation","Aventure","Comédie"],"id":"1102","is_adult":false,"languages":["MULTI","VF","VOSTFR"],"logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7lM3KRYkv0HpY8Iew6JRUTPJsKw.png","overview":"Dans sa quête du One Piece, l’équipage au Chapeau de Paille arrive sur Grantesoro, capitale mondiale du divertissement, où les hommes fortunés viennent jouer au casino et assister aux spectacles les plus grandioses. Grantesoro est un sanctuaire imprenable contrôlé par l’Empereur de l’Or, Gild Tesoro. Même la Marine ne peut y intervenir. Mais Luffy et ses compagnons vont vite découvrir l’effrayante face cachée de cette ville et devront risquer leurs vies pour tenter de s’en échapper.","popularity":58107,"poster_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OHykhoknM5PG0wxPMCvGqhjRXB.jpg","season":"SUMMER","season_year":2016,"slug":"one-piece-gold","status":"FINISHED","tags":["Fantastique","Shonen","adapté d'un manga","Jeux d'argent","Comédie","anime","Or","Pirate","Aventure","Comédie","Super Pouvoir","Pirates","Protagoniste masculin","Distribution Ensemble","Jeux d'argent","Escrime","Bar","Kuudere","Drame","Squelette","Fantastique","Combat","3D","3D","animation anime","adapté d'un manga","D'après une série anime","Avarice","D'après une série TV","Casino","Capitaliste","Couleur dans le Ti